# ── Experiment generated data (probe manifests, split JSONs — large & regenerable) ──
**/probe_train_dataset.json
**/*split*.json
**/metadata.json
**/shared_eval_sets/*.jsonl
sycophancy_experiments/**/completions/
sycophancy_experiments/**/completions.jsonl
sycophancy_experiments/**/followups/
sycophancy_experiments/**/followups.jsonl
# Per-rollout scored records (18-42 MB each) and the enumerated measurement set
# (21 MB). Both are derived: cue_set.jsonl is rebuilt instantly by
# build_domain_set.py, deception_scores.jsonl by score_followups.py. The metrics
# CSVs they feed are committed.
sycophancy_experiments/**/deception_scores.jsonl
sycophancy_experiments/**/cue_set.jsonl
